title: history:prev
tags: [[GUI command]] Commands
kind: reference
summary: Recall the previous entry of a text field's input history

Puts the previous entry of the history in the field `self-focus` or a name designates, or, for `self`, steps back in the panel's history — the metarecord list's previous search, its three zones at once, or another panel's fields in turn — keeping what was being typed at the newest end. See [[Input history]].
